# pstack

pstack lives at {{DSH_HOME}}/pstack (vendored from cursor/plugins, MIT). It is opt-in per message.

When the user starts a message with `/poteto-mode`, or asks for pstack, read {{DSH_HOME}}/adapter/dsh.md once,
then read {{DSH_HOME}}/skills/poteto-mode/SKILL.md in full and follow it, including its Principles index and
its playbooks. Resolve every relative path in those files against the skill's own directory. Selecting the
`pstack` agent preset does the same thing without the slash command.

Subagent model aliases for pstack roles (never pass a Cursor slug to DSH):

    deepseek = magpie / deepseek/deepseek-flash / max
    gpt      = magpie-responses / codex/gpt-6.1-sol / medium
    inherit-parent or auto = omit provider and model

# budget: custom (deepseek max, gpt medium)
feature, refactoring: deepseek
bug-fix: deepseek
perf-issue: deepseek
hillclimb: deepseek
judgment and prose: gpt
hardest tasks: gpt
swarm workers: deepseek
how explorer: deepseek
how explainer: gpt
why investigators: deepseek
why synthesizer: gpt
reflect tooling: deepseek
reflect judgment, divergent, synthesizer: gpt
arena runners: deepseek, gpt
arena cross-judge pool: gpt, deepseek
architect runners: gpt, deepseek
interrogate reviewers: gpt, deepseek
<!-- pstack:end -->
